sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as ProfileCardFull
    participant H as useSwipeGesture
    participant API as api (web)
    participant MC as MatchController
    participant MS as MatchService
    participant MR as MatchRepository
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant CC as ChatController
    participant CS as ChatService
    participant CR as ChatRepository

    Note over U,P: LIKE / SUPERLIKE (swipe or button)
    U->>P: swipe right / tap Like
    P->>H: drag > threshold
    H-->>P: onSwipe('right')
    P->>API: postMatchAction(userId,'like')
    API->>MC: like
    MC->>MS: expressInterest(like)
    MS->>MR: upsertAction('liked')
    MR-->>MS: Match(status)
    alt becomes mutual (other already liked/superliked)
        MS->>NS: create 'mutual_match' (both users)
    else action is superlike (not yet mutual)
        MS->>NS: create 'superlike_received' (target, anonymous)
    end
    MS-->>MC: {status, mutual, matchId}
    MC-->>API: success(result)
    API-->>P: resolve
    P->>P: animate card out, advance deck
    opt mutual
        P->>P: show MatchCelebration + "Message" CTA
    end

    Note over U,BottomNav: RECIPIENT LATER (badge poll)
    BottomNav->>API: getSuperlikesReceived()
    API->>MC: superlikesReceived
    MC->>MS: getSuperlikesReceived()
    MS->>MR: findSuperlikesReceived(userId)
    MR-->>MS: Match[] (anonymous)
    MS-->>MC: {items, count}
    MC-->>API: success({items,count})
    API-->>BottomNav: count -> Matches badge

    Note over U,P: START CHAT FROM MUTUAL MATCH
    U->>P: tap "Message"
    P->>API: createConversation(targetUserId)
    API->>CC: create
    CC->>CS: getOrCreateConversation(me, target)
    CS->>MS: isMutual(me, target)
    MS-->>CS: true
    CS->>CR: findOrCreateConversation(me, target)
    CR-->>CS: Conversation
    CS-->>CC: {id,...}
    CC-->>API: success(conversation)
    API-->>P: conversationId
    P->>P: router.push(/portal/messages?c=id)
